@node MAIN "EdgeSnap 0.42 beta"
@{b}EdgeSnap 0.42 beta@{ub}
Window snapping for AmigaOS 4.x, MorphOS and AROS (x86_64 and aarch64)
by Michele Dipace <michele.dipace@kaffeine.net>

  @{" What it does        " link ABOUT}
  @{" Installing it       " link INSTALL}
  @{" Using it            " link USING}
